      "title": "SPI Telegram links pending",
      "description": "Condition inputs for SPI Telegram links pending. Exact rule expression; gaps mean no matching evaluation or missing telemetry, not proof of health. This rule-scoped panel may show multiple affected series; identify the alert target by its legend labels.",
